{"title":"Self-fulfilling misalignment?","link":"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/955603223/0/marginalrevolution~Selffulfilling-misalignment.html","date":1778309643000,"content":"<p><a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://x.com/AnthropicAI/status/2052808791301697563?s=20\" target=\"_blank\">From Anthropic</a>:</p>\r\n<blockquote><p>We started by investigating why Claude chose to blackmail. We believe the original source of the behavior was internet text that portrays AI as evil and interested in self-preservation.</p></blockquote>\r\n<p>And here is <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://turntrout.com/self-fulfilling-misalignment\" target=\"_blank\">Alex Turner on the topic of self-fulfilling misalignment</a>.  I raised this possibility some while ago <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://www.thefp.com/p/what-happens-when-your-ai-goes-nazi\" target=\"_blank\">in a Free Press column</a>, and mainly was met with hostility.</p>\r\n<p>The social return to a positive world view, and avoiding negative emotional contagion, never has been higher.</p>\r\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2026/05/self-fulfilling-misalignment.html\">Self-fulfilling misalignment?</a> appeared first on <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://marginalrevolution.com\">Marginal REVOLUTION</a>.</p>\r\n<img height=\"1\" width=\"1\" src=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/i/955603223/0/marginalrevolution\" />\r\n<div><a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/28/955603223/marginalrevolution\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/fblike20.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/29/955603223/marginalrevolution,\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/pinterest20.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/24/955603223/marginalr